Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.69,0:00:02.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.35,0:00:05.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Normal pulse, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.08,0:00:07.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.67,0:00:09.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did your company go under?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.58,0:00:10.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It did not.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.90,0:00:12.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you kill some—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.27,0:00:13.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I did not.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.54,0:00:15.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then why would you do something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.32,0:00:18.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean invite you to my house?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.13,0:00:22.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You must have a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.62,0:00:24.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I felt like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.77,0:00:27.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.88,0:00:31.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, you really just want to hang out?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.88,0:00:31.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You never do things because you "feel like it"!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.22,0:00:31.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.05,0:00:33.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Great. I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.66,0:00:35.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay. When works for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.70,0:00:38.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about... Sunday?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.60,0:00:39.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.62,0:00:41.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now that's settled, time to plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.24,0:00:43.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This has gotten fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.62,0:00:47.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, how about I bring something to snack on?{some snacks?}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.03,0:00:48.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What would you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.30,0:00:51.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes! I'd like something pricey.{expensive?}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.79,0:00:53.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm asking Neiru.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.66,0:00:56.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll bring a takoyaki maker.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.48,0:00:58.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Forget that junk for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.24,0:00:59.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Junk"?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.23,0:01:00.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.30,0:01:03.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, does Sunday work for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.30,0:01:03.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, that might be nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.69,0:01:03.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.13,0:01:05.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, what about you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.19,0:01:07.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.82,0:01:09.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't miss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.87,0:02:46.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a recording of President Aonuma's dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.28,0:02:49.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Using the technology developed here,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.87,0:02:55.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it is possible to analyze brainwaves \Nand convert the subject's dreams to video.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.37,0:02:55.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.10,0:02:58.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're not dreams, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.01,0:03:00.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But they're not reality either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.37,0:03:05.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Science is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.37,0:03:06.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The picture is still rough and monochrome,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.91,0:03:06.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai, have her record you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.95,0:03:10.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll get a sexy fantasy out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.95,0:03:10.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but with more research, it will \None day be clear and in full color.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.44,0:03:10.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't lump me in with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.50,0:03:13.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you live at your company.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.04,0:03:15.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This feels like a field trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.03,0:03:17.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who are you, anyway, Neiru?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.54,0:03:20.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What an existentialist question.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.04,0:03:21.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.45,0:03:24.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you familiar with a group called Plati?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.44,0:03:29.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. I heard only people with really high IQs can join.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.43,0:03:33.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Neiru is a member of Japan Plati.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.88,0:03:36.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow. I knew you were really smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.04,0:03:39.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm just good at thinking logically.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.47,0:03:41.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How modest, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.68,0:03:44.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was born via artificial insemination of a member.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.25,0:03:48.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, so that's why you said you never had parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.87,0:03:52.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For real? They won't tell you who your parents are?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.52,0:03:55.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There'd be no point. It was just a pairing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.28,0:03:58.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That puts {\i1}my{\i0} worries in perspective.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.27,0:04:03.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've reached floor B9.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.66,0:04:07.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is our medical floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.56,0:04:09.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you a doctor too, Neiru?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.62,0:04:12.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No. I'm not in charge of this floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.58,0:04:14.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm just filling in for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.72,0:04:16.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, are we there yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.95,0:04:18.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here.\NWhoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.10,0:04:21.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well then, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.16,0:04:23.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.53,0:04:24.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.89,0:04:27.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.89,0:04:27.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.26,0:04:27.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is your room, Neiru?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.75,0:04:32.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa, books galore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.59,0:04:36.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Neiru,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.88,0:04:38.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,what's this guy's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.60,0:04:39.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.84,0:04:40.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can I touch him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.49,0:04:44.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure.\NClean up all this paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.48,0:04:45.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.95,0:04:47.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where should we eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.90,0:04:49.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.61,0:04:53.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've got exams next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.76,0:04:55.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I haven't studied at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.14,0:04:57.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.84,0:04:59.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're lucky, Neiru.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.97,0:05:02.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You get to run this huge company.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.27,0:05:06.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's like we live in different worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.94,0:05:08.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.58,0:05:11.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyway, Rika, isn't it about time?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.70,0:05:15.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, let's get started!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.73,0:05:25.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yesterday, Rika and I got worked \Nup talking about fun things to do.{thinking of?}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.94,0:05:27.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a pretty color.{that's/such}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.18,0:05:28.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.87,0:05:30.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Grown-up, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.39,0:05:33.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We thought we could all do our nails and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.40,0:05:36.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll do Neiru's.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.40,0:05:36.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.40,0:05:37.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Show me your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.40,0:05:38.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ever painted them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.98,0:05:37.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.08,0:05:39.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have pretty nails.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.08,0:05:41.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I won't screw up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.08,0:05:41.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.76,0:05:41.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do I really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.91,0:05:46.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're good, Momo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.99,0:05:47.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You could go pro.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.54,0:05:49.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.88,0:05:52.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I think I'd like to be a dietitian.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.96,0:05:55.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking of going to school for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.19,0:05:58.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow. I'm impressed you're thinking about that stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.81,0:06:00.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to go abroad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.34,0:06:03.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't working in English be cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.69,0:06:06.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then an international marriage to a hot guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.14,0:06:07.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.92,0:06:10.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder where I want to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.28,0:06:12.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hang on, we're not talking about vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.67,0:06:15.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, but I might want to try living on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.25,0:06:17.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.57,0:06:19.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's a dream of mine, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.19,0:06:21.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There. All done.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.90,0:06:25.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One's a different color.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.43,0:06:27.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We match.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.63,0:06:33.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And you, Neiru?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.45,0:06:35.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's your dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.86,0:06:37.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, you haven't told us yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.24,0:06:41.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess we're all sharing our dreams now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.57,0:06:46.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think I'll probably stay like this forever.\NHuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.40,0:06:49.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, I didn't mean that earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.60,0:06:51.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't have to run a company your whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.11,0:06:54.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, if you like books, why not become a writer?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.68,0:06:56.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me introduce a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.30,0:06:58.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want you to meet her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.26,0:07:00.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.23,0:07:15.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Someone's inside.{ugh}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.89,0:07:19.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She was born at Japan Plati like I was.\NAwano Kotobuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.15,0:07:21.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kotobuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.64,0:07:23.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Adam is her pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.56,0:07:24.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Her hair color...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.08,0:07:25.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's albino.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.80,0:07:28.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.65,0:07:32.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Albinos are said to bring good\Nfortune to those around them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.85,0:07:37.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kotobuki was always cheerful and optimistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.08,0:07:39.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She'd tell me to "really enjoy myself."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.55,0:07:41.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Was"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.68,0:07:43.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't she just sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.06,0:07:46.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's in a vegetative state.\NHuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.79,0:07:49.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kotobuki was a doctor of psychiatry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.45,0:07:52.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She was scientifically analyzing the mysteries of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.73,0:07:54.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Death, in particular.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.57,0:08:00.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She performed near-death experiments, \Nand eventually didn't come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.69,0:08:01.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Near-death experiments...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.34,0:08:05.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scientists try to solve difficult problems. It's in their nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.96,0:08:08.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She was your friend, wasn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.33,0:08:12.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. I met Kotobuki in a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.40,0:08:12.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.76,0:08:14.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An Egg dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.99,0:08:19.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.94,0:08:20.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's Pinky.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.23,0:08:22.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is he a type of corn snake?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.64,0:08:24.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.86,0:08:28.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time, Neiru.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.69,0:08:30.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kotobuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.66,0:08:32.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is Adam well?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.29,0:08:35.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. You look well, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.95,0:08:37.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess. I'm not bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.31,0:08:40.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still, I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.71,0:08:42.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I get a chance to say goodbye to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.46,0:08:44.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd better thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.44,0:08:47.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're not children of God, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.19,0:08:51.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scientists who can't believe in God are incompetent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.52,0:08:55.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not a scientist at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.13,0:08:57.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.50,0:08:59.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course. Just needling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.50,0:09:04.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll protect me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.46,0:09:09.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or do you want me to protect you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.24,0:09:13.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's nice. What a lovely weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.16,0:09:17.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's really enjoy ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.89,0:09:22.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.74,0:09:26.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pinky!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.98,0:09:32.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's that? It's hilarious!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.72,0:09:35.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Faster! Faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.59,0:09:37.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They'll catch us if we don't hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.58,0:09:40.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kotobuki, why did you die?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.05,0:09:42.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why couldn't you come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.45,0:09:45.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When adrenaline enters the brain,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.17,0:09:48.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,they say you see a field of flowers\Nto overcome the fear of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.20,0:09:52.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wanted to pick one and bring it back to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.38,0:09:54.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This isn't funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.06,0:09:56.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't forgive any more jokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.78,0:09:59.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The me in the world you're in did die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.18,0:10:02.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But that allowed me to experience it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.50,0:10:05.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was right, Neiru: Parallel worlds do exist!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.18,0:10:08.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The possibility of worlds that might have been.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.08,0:10:11.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was your favorite genre of fiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.33,0:10:15.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes! Our parallel selves are alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.21,0:10:18.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's nice, but I can't see you ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.14,0:10:22.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Being satisfied with seeing each other is so commonplace.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.42,0:10:25.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're not some couple that can't handle long-distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.39,0:10:27.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't be so philosophical about it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.24,0:10:40.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At stage four Thanato, there was a sweet smell like honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.03,0:10:44.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I felt like an insect preyed upon by a carnivorous plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.75,0:10:45.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The temptation of death?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.72,0:10:48.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not so much "temptation."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.80,0:10:50.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,More like my mind and body were abducted.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.13,0:10:52.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Abducted? By what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.42,0:10:54.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By innocent sorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.35,0:10:58.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What chatty guinea pigs you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.58,0:11:08.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ow. That hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.88,0:11:10.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where's Pinky?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.11,0:11:12.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Back in my pendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.86,0:11:14.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. He'll regenerate soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.62,0:11:16.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.61,0:11:17.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.36,0:11:21.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No matter what it takes, I'll go to the place where you died
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.92,0:11:23.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and bring your statue back to—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.36,0:11:25.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't envision dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.09,0:11:28.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't reach an abstract place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.55,0:11:31.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then I'll use near-death experiments, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.80,0:11:32.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.46,0:11:35.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you went to that zone, you'd die, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.70,0:11:37.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What would happen to me in reality then?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.19,0:11:41.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where did you go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.62,0:11:43.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You must know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.00,0:11:46.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The government will come for my body someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.87,0:11:48.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't let them do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.54,0:11:50.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just a container.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.22,0:11:53.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I was attached to it in my own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.90,0:11:55.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want adults touching it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.15,0:11:57.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.45,0:12:00.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then you must know what I want you to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.91,0:12:02.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.75,0:12:03.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.35,0:12:06.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know you're not that dense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.27,0:12:18.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.52,0:12:20.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are you always so selfish?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.01,0:12:25.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In the end, you left me to deal with everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.46,0:12:29.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Won't you praise my original research methods?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.83,0:12:33.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't consider other people's feelings at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.93,0:12:35.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're used to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.66,0:12:38.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's still not normal to just die!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.90,0:12:41.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't abnormality more fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.43,0:12:43.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not fun for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.20,0:12:45.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look at your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.35,0:12:49.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's fine. You made new friends, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.31,0:12:50.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How did...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.78,0:12:54.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're softer than you used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.11,0:12:57.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But they're not like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.57,0:12:59.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You made connections with people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.68,0:13:01.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's a wonderful thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.37,0:13:03.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Treasure them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.28,0:13:06.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You aren't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.21,0:13:10.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll make friends with those girls in another world-line.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.26,0:13:20.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I finally caught you, you cocky brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.60,0:13:21.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kotobuki,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.60,0:13:21.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.29,0:13:25.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't be satisfied until I cut open your pretty little chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.37,0:13:26.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.66,0:13:28.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, Kotobuki,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.34,0:13:32.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Doctor Seki! You stole my job\Nas chief of the medical center!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.39,0:13:38.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll analyze every micron of your body \Nand return to those glorious days!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.85,0:13:40.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.04,0:13:42.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, the guy who was obsessed with my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.62,0:13:45.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, this is my trauma.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.42,0:13:49.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's true that he's the last person I'd want to dissect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.80,0:13:50.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.13,0:13:53.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.13,0:14:19.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.37,0:14:21.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm the world-famous Seki!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.02,0:14:23.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have numerous doctorates!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.39,0:14:26.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My\Npapers have been published in Future!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.92,0:14:29.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've been on the cover of Future.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.70,0:14:30.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.40,0:14:32.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ha! I won't accept it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.41,0:14:34.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If that's true, solve this problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.96,0:14:38.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's ultra-difficult, with a zero-percent success rate!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.72,0:14:42.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Find the radius of a circle that\Nintersects points A, B, C, and D.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.78,0:14:46.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Only a genius can solve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.16,0:14:48.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.63,0:14:50.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So will I.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.24,0:14:53.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You little brats could never figure it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.70,0:14:55.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to blow your mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.14,0:14:57.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.94,0:15:01.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The answer is\Nthere is no such circle!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.49,0:15:02.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.00,0:15:07.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These little girls solved a problem\Nnot even I could? In seconds?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.80,0:15:09.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No need.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.61,0:15:21.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doctor what's-his-name had pride, if nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.29,0:15:23.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pride chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.43,0:15:26.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was it that funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.31,0:15:29.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You sounded like a friend of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.72,0:15:33.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bravo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.02,0:15:36.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take care of the me in reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.24,0:15:37.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.37,0:15:40.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What should you do? Say it in words.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.16,0:15:41.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.34,0:15:44.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because you always do what you say you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.05,0:15:48.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll disconnect your life support.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.80,0:15:51.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good. Sorry for a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.83,0:15:53.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.23,0:15:55.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.74,0:16:00.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kotobuki was in an Egg?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.08,0:16:03.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. There can't even be a miracle now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.91,0:16:05.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kotobuki is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.79,0:16:09.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still, you're not even related. You can't just...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.67,0:16:10.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.00,0:16:14.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But if I delay, the government will come for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.51,0:16:16.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An albino genius is a valuable sample.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.43,0:16:18.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A sample...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.68,0:16:20.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But that's just an excuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.26,0:16:22.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you kill a girl like her for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.69,0:16:24.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She looks alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.27,0:16:25.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like she's just sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.48,0:16:28.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.94,0:16:30.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just a container.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.65,0:16:35.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I can't watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.11,0:16:39.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's different from killing Seeno Evils or Haters {\i1}there{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.16,0:16:41.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah! This is for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.20,0:16:45.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's too much, even if she did ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.29,0:16:47.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you're just going to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.87,0:16:49.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then just go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.54,0:16:52.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't ask you to take a field trip here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.88,0:16:55.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't say it like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.96,0:16:57.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're worried, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.75,0:16:58.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.97,0:17:00.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mean, you're our friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.76,0:17:04.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you do that, you might end up \Nwith trauma, or baggage, or...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.06,0:17:06.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no problem, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.23,0:17:11.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't get sentimental about\Nstopping a dead person's respiration.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.71,0:17:17.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.49,0:17:19.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Being smart is scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.24,0:17:22.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm more frightened of others' overheated passions.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.91,0:17:26.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you talking about me?! Are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.46,0:17:27.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.83,0:17:27.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh!?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.41,0:17:28.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop it, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.21,0:17:30.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kotobuki can hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.21,0:17:35.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey. That's normal human sentimentality, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.21,0:17:38.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Worrying she might hear us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.59,0:17:39.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.84,0:17:44.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyway, Neiru, you should at least sleep on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.94,0:17:54.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going back after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.19,0:17:55.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ai!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.65,0:17:59.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai can get close to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.49,0:18:02.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She might have better luck changing Neiru's mind alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.16,0:18:05.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.74,0:18:07.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It seems like Neiru's being stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.66,0:18:09.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai might get through.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.09,0:18:19.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,President Aonuma is getting closer\Nto the truth behind the temptation of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.92,0:18:21.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kotobuki did give her a hint.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.22,0:18:23.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Innocent sorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.26,0:18:27.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You managed to deflect her with an excuse, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.56,0:18:30.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Girls' suicides.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.43,0:18:33.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we told them the real reason, none of them would fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.02,0:18:37.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Not if they knew the root cause is the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.28,0:18:39.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.86,0:18:42.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think they would actually fight against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.07,0:18:46.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because they're girls, they understand girls' sorrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.12,0:18:48.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.20,0:18:52.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's connected to Acca and Ura-Acca, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.92,0:18:55.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You came to stop me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.23,0:18:58.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to hear about Kotobuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.30,0:18:59.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.59,0:19:02.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What else did Kotobuki say?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.18,0:19:03.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.09,0:19:07.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why did she want you to do that for her?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.51,0:19:10.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She doesn't want adults to touch her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.39,0:19:16.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See? If you'd told us that, the others\Nwould have been more understanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.94,0:19:18.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.48,0:19:19.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.82,0:19:22.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're not very upfront, Neiru.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.74,0:19:32.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I really... tried to push it,\Nbut my fingers shook.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.41,0:19:33.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.71,0:19:39.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One time, Koito and I tried fortune-telling using Kokkuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.42,0:19:43.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We asked if Koito's crush liked her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.88,0:19:46.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think it was probably Mr. Sawaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.97,0:19:47.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.10,0:19:49.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The coin landed on "yes."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.56,0:19:54.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't move it, so I thought Koito did,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.27,0:19:56.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but she seemed really happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.65,0:20:02.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wondered if she'd be that happy if she'd moved it herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.53,0:20:08.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe I moved it without knowing, to make Koito happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.16,0:20:11.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But... I really don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.91,0:20:14.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what fantasy is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.90,0:20:16.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.04,0:20:19.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With two of us...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.63,0:20:20.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's fantasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.80,0:20:26.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kotobuki's body was scheduled\Nfor collection tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.43,0:20:26.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.30,0:20:30.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you want something done before that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.10,0:20:34.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was you who made Neiru's\NWonder Egg Kotobuki, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.89,0:20:37.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.82,0:20:44.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.70,0:20:49.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"It is the hour to be drunken!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.99,0:20:52.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be drunken, if you would not be martyred slaves of Time;
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.45,0:20:55.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,be drunken continually!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.91,0:21:00.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With wine, with poetry, or with virtue, as you will."
